1
00:01:01,006 --> 00:01:02,040
<i>How are you?</i>

2
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:04,133
<i>Fine, I guess. Seeing you cheat on me.</i>

3
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:07,800
<i>If lawyers get involved, the police
will find out the clip is AI-generated.</i>

4
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,496
<i>I don't care if Nat gets the wrong idea.</i>

5
00:01:10,496 --> 00:01:13,040
<i>What worries me is that Nat was drugged.</i>

6
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:16,480
<i>The herbalist said
if Master Lert drinks too much,</i>

7
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,280
<i>it could kill him.</i>

8
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:20,010
<i>Your tonic, sir.</i>

9
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,353
<i>Yo.</i>

10
00:01:27,353 --> 00:01:28,360
<i>You...</i>

11
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,715
<i>drugged me.</i>

12
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:41,406
Thanks for understanding.

13
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:45,040
I was angry at first.

14
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:47,520
But your reasons make sense.

15
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:50,080
The title deed may be in Yo's name,

16
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:52,420
but you're the one who gets to use it.

17
00:02:02,619 --> 00:02:05,653
[Gift - Nat Thanahirankit]
[Lifetime Usufruct]

18
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,806
Let's have some fun.

19
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,113
Why isn't Yo responding?

20
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,613
Yo.

21
00:02:56,960 --> 00:03:00,958
Nat, did you give her too much?

22
00:03:00,958 --> 00:03:02,918
I gave her exactly what you told me.

23
00:03:02,918 --> 00:03:05,400
If you gave her what I told you to,

24
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,700
she should be high and having fun with us.

25
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:10,413
Unless...

26
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,520
Yo!

27
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,040
Yo!

28
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,600
Yo!

29
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,695
- Yo!
- Yo! Don't die on me, Yo!

30
00:03:18,695 --> 00:03:19,810
- Yo!
- Hey! Yo!

31
00:03:19,810 --> 00:03:21,520
- Yo!
- Hey! Yo!

32
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,500
We should get Yo to the hospital.

33
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:26,120
No, Pam. If we take her there,

34
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,920
everyone will know we drugged her.

35
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,520
No. I'm scared.

36
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,680
I'm scared we'll get arrested.

37
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,413
What if Yo dies?

38
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,620
No.

39
00:03:39,620 --> 00:03:41,220
I had nothing to do with this.

40
00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:42,913
This was your plan.

41
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,640
Our plan?

42
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,560
You're the one who drugged Yo.

43
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,480
This is your fault.

44
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,518
No. I had nothing to do with this.

45
00:03:51,518 --> 00:03:52,700
Nat!

46
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,680
Pam, Nat's gone!

47
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,413
He's going to pin all the blame on us!

48
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:03,006
No. I won't let him.

49
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,400
You choose.

50
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:25,116
Will you fight back,
or die like before, Kadkao?

51
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:35,820
I'll make them all pay.

52
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,100
Your tonic, sir.

53
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:11,213
This tonic really works.
Give some to Kadkao too.

54
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,420
Yes, sir.

55
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,610
Master is so kind to you, Kadkao.

56
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,710
Drink it.

57
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,226
Kadkao.

58
00:05:50,226 --> 00:05:51,818
What's wrong?

59
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,826
Kadkao!

60
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,113
Kadkao!

61
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,713
Kadkao!

62
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,116
Kadkao!

63
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:08,125
The tonic you ordered
may be too strong for Kadkao.

64
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:12,906
If Kadkao dies,
it'll be because you gave the order.

65
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,626
Kadkao!

66
00:06:16,851 --> 00:06:18,215
Kadkao!

67
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,840
Kadkao!

68
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:25,318
Kadkao! Kadkao!

69
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,605
Is anyone there? Come here!

70
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,698
Go get the doctor.

71
00:06:38,698 --> 00:06:40,800
The Western doctor is out of town, sir.

72
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,960
Damn it! Useless!

73
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,816
I'll find another doctor myself.

74
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:08,314
Sroi, get the servants
to throw Kadkao's body to the vultures.

75
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,304
Yes, ma'am.

76
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:33,916
You want revenge, don't you?

77
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,515
I'll help you.

78
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:58,813
My lady, won't you bind Kadkao's soul
like you did with Pan, Yohd, and Sali?

79
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,813
Good idea.

80
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,115
Drag her body away.

81
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,916
Kadkao! You're still alive!

82
00:08:24,916 --> 00:08:28,115
Yeah... I'm still alive.

83
00:08:28,115 --> 00:08:30,609
You're the ones who are going to die.

84
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,708
My lady!

85
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:45,016
Help my lady! Hurry!

86
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,600
Kadkao!

87
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,705
You'll die all over again!

88
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:25,311
You think you'll survive, Kadkao?

89
00:09:25,311 --> 00:09:27,121
Here, my lady!

90
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:55,302
You'll suffer a hundred,
a thousand times more than I did.

91
00:10:01,416 --> 00:10:04,718
Is Kadkao a ghost?

92
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:08,760
That's right... I'm a ghost.

93
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,198
I've come to take revenge on all of you!

94
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:16,080
My lady, run! Go! Go!

95
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,520
Watch out!

96
00:10:25,710 --> 00:10:27,480
Bulan!

97
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,602
Sroi!

98
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,280
I'll never let you live in peace!

99
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,720
I won't let Yo die.

100
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,721
[Dr. Mote]

101
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,305
Pick up, Doctor!

102
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,921
Why aren't you answering?

103
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:02,423
Why aren't you answering?

104
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:23,105
<i>You... drugged me.</i>

105
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:33,005
Bulan!

106
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,200
Sroi!

107
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,814
Where are you?

108
00:11:37,444 --> 00:11:39,674
I stabbed her twice!

109
00:11:39,674 --> 00:11:41,517
How can she still be alive?

110
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,735
But she died, ma'am.

111
00:11:44,735 --> 00:11:46,808
Kadkao is a ghost.

112
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,099
Don't, Bulan!

113
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,905
Kadkao.

114
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,807
You're still alive.

115
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,114
Why are you looking at me like that?

116
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,040
Kadkao is already dead.

117
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,709
This is a ghost!

118
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,160
A ghost?

119
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:12,810
Yes. We're ghosts.

120
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,240
Pan!

121
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,205
Yohd! Sali!

122
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,680
Yeah... it's us.

123
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:24,560
Today, you're all going to die!

124
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:25,897
Kadkao,

125
00:13:27,132 --> 00:13:29,160
I love you.

126
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:31,400
Don't let them take over!

127
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,332
Don't believe him!

128
00:13:40,332 --> 00:13:42,520
How many times has he fooled you, you idiot?

129
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,497
You have to take revenge!

130
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:56,492
Kadkao's possessed...

131
00:13:56,492 --> 00:13:58,108
Restrain her!

132
00:13:58,108 --> 00:14:03,026
Anyone there? Come help!
Restrain Kadkao! Hurry!

133
00:14:03,026 --> 00:14:05,887
Come on! Just try it!

134
00:14:05,887 --> 00:14:07,240
Restrain her!

135
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,514
Hurry!

136
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,922
Get something to tie her up!

137
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,707
Let me go!

138
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,106
Kill her!

139
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,697
Don't!

140
00:14:34,697 --> 00:14:36,112
Master!

141
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,680
Are you going to let her kill us?

142
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,767
You know that's not Kadkao!

143
00:14:40,767 --> 00:14:41,920
That's exactly why.

144
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:43,908
No one is to harm Kadkao.

145
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:48,022
You really want to challenge me?

146
00:14:48,022 --> 00:14:50,810
- Go get Shaman Kham.
- Yes, sir! Let's go! Hurry!

147
00:14:51,439 --> 00:14:54,320
This time, I'll bind your souls,

148
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:58,505
so you'll never be reborn,
not in a billion lifetimes!

149
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,547
<i>Hey, Doctor.</i>

150
00:15:30,547 --> 00:15:32,100
<i>What's up, Nat?</i>

151
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,560
<i>I accidentally gave Yo some drugs.</i>

152
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:37,505
<i>She's unconscious. What should I do?</i>

153
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:40,480
<i>Get her to a hospital now.</i>

154
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,920
<i>I can't.</i>

155
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,104
<i>Why not?</i>

156
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:47,008
<i>I gave her too much of a date rape drug.</i>

157
00:15:47,008 --> 00:15:50,120
<i>Doctor, you have to help me.
I don't want Yo to die.</i>

158
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:55,391
<i>It can suppress her breathing
and severely affect her nervous system.</i>

159
00:15:55,391 --> 00:15:58,417
<i>The only way to save her
is to get her to a hospital now.</i>

160
00:15:58,417 --> 00:16:03,280
<i>If her heart stops, start CPR
and get her pulse back.</i>

161
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:05,017
<i>Thanks, Doctor.</i>

162
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:16,400
<i>Hello, Yo.</i>

163
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:18,117
What is it, Officer?

164
00:17:20,840 --> 00:17:23,200
Can I speak to Yo?

165
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,600
Yo's asleep.

166
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:27,414
And we're back together now.

167
00:17:27,414 --> 00:17:29,303
Stay away from Yo.

168
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,912
Why should I believe you?

169
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:36,610
Because I'm Yo's legal husband.

170
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,499
Take care of this case for me.

171
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,512
Something wrong?

172
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:07,450
I just checked my home security camera.

173
00:18:07,450 --> 00:18:08,603
Yo wasn't there.

174
00:18:08,603 --> 00:18:10,200
And when I called her,

175
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,115
Nat answered instead.

176
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,402
Something doesn't feel right.

177
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,013
What did you do to Yo?

178
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,604
Mind your own business.

179
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:47,705
You're the one who should stay away from Yo.

180
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,600
If anything happens to Yo,

181
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:01,685
you'll be facing charges.

182
00:19:01,685 --> 00:19:03,280
I'll have you arrested!

183
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,413
For police brutality!

184
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:08,227
Go right ahead.

185
00:19:08,227 --> 00:19:11,306
I'll testify that you attacked Pete first.

186
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:33,808
Pam, are we going to get arrested?

187
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:36,142
Yo's not dead.

188
00:19:36,142 --> 00:19:37,813
What would they arrest us for?

189
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:47,796
[Intensive Care Unit]

190
00:19:47,796 --> 00:19:53,603
[ICU 3 - Yotaka Thanahirankit]
[Dr. Atchariya Pengyasa]

191
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,598
How's Yo?

192
00:20:13,228 --> 00:20:16,118
The doctor says they still need to monitor her.

193
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,624
If she was drugged,

194
00:20:19,624 --> 00:20:21,905
it may already be out of her system.

195
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:25,000
We'll have to rely
on physical evidence instead.

196
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:28,696
If we find any evidence,
those three are going down.

197
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:48,800
I'll press charges against all of you!

198
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:52,014
You can't just barge in
and search someone's home!

199
00:20:52,014 --> 00:20:56,720
Under Section 92 (2) and (4)
of the Criminal Procedure Code,

200
00:20:56,720 --> 00:21:00,200
officers may conduct a search without a warrant

201
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:02,557
if there's reasonable cause to believe

202
00:21:02,557 --> 00:21:06,812
key evidence may be moved or concealed.

203
00:21:09,145 --> 00:21:10,905
Please cooperate with us.

204
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:28,582
Whan, go keep an eye on them.

205
00:21:28,582 --> 00:21:32,413
They might plant something illegal.

206
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:36,411
Okay.

207
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,877
I knew Yo wasn't dying.

208
00:21:48,877 --> 00:21:53,045
She just fainted,
but you took her to the hospital.

209
00:21:53,045 --> 00:21:57,760
The results of Yo's tests are in.

210
00:21:57,760 --> 00:22:00,082
The drug she was given

211
00:22:00,082 --> 00:22:01,760
damaged her nervous system

212
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:04,230
and suppressed her breathing,

213
00:22:04,230 --> 00:22:07,797
depriving her brain of oxygen.

214
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:11,101
She's now in a coma.

215
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:19,582
You don't have to tell me now
what drug you gave Yo.

216
00:22:19,582 --> 00:22:23,010
Wait until the police
finish gathering the evidence.

217
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:25,503
Until then,

218
00:22:26,170 --> 00:22:32,302
all three of you will have to testify
during the investigation and in court.

219
00:23:21,600 --> 00:23:25,080
The doctor said Yo is out of danger.

220
00:23:25,080 --> 00:23:27,117
But they still need to monitor her

221
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:30,404
and wait for her to regain consciousness.

222
00:23:30,404 --> 00:23:32,707
Her body may be recovering,

223
00:23:32,707 --> 00:23:34,411
but the reason she hasn't woken up

224
00:23:34,411 --> 00:23:37,807
may be that her spirit
is no longer in her body.

225
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:41,194
You mean...

226
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:47,360
Yo's spirit has gone back to the past

227
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:51,004
to settle the resentment that still haunts her.

228
00:23:51,004 --> 00:23:54,120
We shouldn't let her remain
separated from her body for too long.

229
00:23:54,120 --> 00:23:56,090
Please help Yo.

230
00:23:56,090 --> 00:23:58,405
I'll do everything I can.

231
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:01,577
As I've always told you,

232
00:24:01,577 --> 00:24:04,322
we can't change anyone's fate.

233
00:24:04,322 --> 00:24:06,823
Everything happens
because of causes and conditions.

234
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:09,822
We each bear our own karma.

235
00:24:25,120 --> 00:24:26,640
Yo.

236
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:28,514
If you can hear me,

237
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:32,005
wherever you are right now,

238
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:35,219
please come back, Yo.

239
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,889
Shaman Kham.

240
00:24:46,889 --> 00:24:48,400
Do whatever it takes.

241
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:50,814
Don't let them come back to haunt me again.

242
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:19,038
With this Sacred Temple Nail,

243
00:25:19,038 --> 00:25:22,139
I'll bind your souls again
so you can never escape,

244
00:25:22,139 --> 00:25:24,919
never to be reborn for all eternity.

245
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:29,396
You took my life,

246
00:25:29,396 --> 00:25:31,200
and now you want to trap my soul too!

247
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,800
You bastards!

248
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:27,760
If you're sending me to hell,

249
00:26:27,760 --> 00:26:30,114
you'll have to lead the way!

250
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:51,800
My lord,

251
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:54,807
it killed Shaman Kham! We have to run!

252
00:27:21,360 --> 00:27:22,982
Lert!

253
00:27:22,982 --> 00:27:24,125
Bulan!

254
00:27:24,125 --> 00:27:25,523
Sroi!

255
00:27:26,360 --> 00:27:28,680
Even if you had wings,

256
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:30,717
you'll never escape me!

257
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,305
Yo.

258
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:10,656
Return to your body. Now!

259
00:28:10,656 --> 00:28:11,915
No!

260
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:14,720
I have to take revenge.

261
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:19,621
The guilty will be punished,
but those three ghosts are using you.

262
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:23,400
None of your business, Chan!

263
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:28,120
Maybe not, but you're creating karma
by using someone else!

264
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:32,000
Believe me. They're using you.

265
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:33,720
Look at Kadkao.

266
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:35,560
She's already dead.

267
00:28:35,560 --> 00:28:37,899
They forced your spirit

268
00:28:37,899 --> 00:28:39,707
to possess Kadkao's body.

269
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:43,200
Don't you pity the dead?

270
00:28:44,237 --> 00:28:46,128
Don't listen to him!

271
00:28:46,128 --> 00:28:48,514
You have to take revenge!

272
00:28:48,514 --> 00:28:52,297
They're evil. No matter the lifetime,
you must pay for your karma!

273
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,807
Don't listen to them, Yo!

274
00:28:54,807 --> 00:28:57,309
Go back before it's too late!

275
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:01,123
Butt out!

276
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,880
You're trying to kill me?

277
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:12,680
After everything I've done for you?

278
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:15,320
And you dragged Yo into this
to take revenge for you!

279
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:17,413
You wretched ghosts!

280
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:21,213
Chan!

281
00:29:22,600 --> 00:29:24,410
Don't hurt him!

282
00:29:28,360 --> 00:29:29,819
Stop!

283
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,302
Uncle!

284
00:29:49,280 --> 00:29:51,226
- Yo.
- Uncle!

285
00:29:51,226 --> 00:29:53,626
Uncle... Why did you hurt him?

286
00:29:53,626 --> 00:29:58,213
He got in my way.
Anyone who gets in my way dies.

287
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:02,321
You damned ghosts!

288
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:07,760
Uncle Chan! Get up!

289
00:30:07,760 --> 00:30:10,000
You have to join us.

290
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:12,040
Make Lert suffer for what he did!

291
00:30:12,040 --> 00:30:13,520
No!

292
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:32,851
Yo.

293
00:30:32,851 --> 00:30:34,118
Yo.

294
00:30:36,800 --> 00:30:38,411
Yo, can you hear me?

295
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,816
It's time to come back.

296
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,807
Come back, Yo.

297
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:50,111
Can you hear me?

298
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,315
No!

299
00:31:17,320 --> 00:31:19,539
Master Lert.

300
00:31:19,539 --> 00:31:21,509
Please help me.

301
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:26,631
I'm still alive, sir.

302
00:31:26,631 --> 00:31:29,017
I'm not a ghost.

303
00:31:32,360 --> 00:31:36,416
Don't believe her. She's a ghost!

304
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:43,205
Master Lert...

305
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:48,407
You're in this room, aren't you?

306
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:51,714
Don't you love me anymore?

307
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:55,520
Please come out to me.

308
00:31:58,440 --> 00:32:01,280
Don't believe her.

309
00:32:01,280 --> 00:32:03,517
The ghosts are trying to lure us out.

310
00:32:08,520 --> 00:32:10,718
Where are you, Master Lert?

311
00:32:11,614 --> 00:32:13,118
Master Lert.

312
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:19,106
- Please help me.
- Master!

313
00:32:21,280 --> 00:32:23,893
Kadkao... Kadkao.

314
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:30,512
Kadkao.

315
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:45,413
Master Lert.

316
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:54,718
Master Lert...

317
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:35,525
You tricked me!

318
00:33:36,640 --> 00:33:39,600
I'll find a powerful shaman
to banish every last one of you!

319
00:33:39,600 --> 00:33:42,325
Then I can finally leave this cursed house!

320
00:33:46,040 --> 00:33:48,322
Go ahead and run, Lert!

321
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:54,507
As long as our souls stay trapped here,

322
00:33:57,360 --> 00:34:02,065
we will hunt you down and haunt you

323
00:34:02,065 --> 00:34:05,117
until you all return here to die!

324
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,315
Kadkao!

325
00:34:48,813 --> 00:34:50,120
Kadkao!

326
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:51,509
Kadkao!

327
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,610
Kadkao...

328
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:59,200
I love you, Kadkao.

329
00:34:59,200 --> 00:35:01,614
Don't leave me like this...

330
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,800
Kadkao!

331
00:35:08,200 --> 00:35:10,497
I'll find a way to bring you back.

332
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:25,517
You shouldn't have done this.

333
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,961
Aren't you the one

334
00:35:27,961 --> 00:35:30,982
who couldn't leave your idiot wife?

335
00:35:30,982 --> 00:35:32,508
And don't forget...

336
00:35:33,200 --> 00:35:35,712
you're the one who drugged her.

337
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:39,035
Whan made me do it!

338
00:35:39,035 --> 00:35:42,958
I told you to use a little, not overdose her!

339
00:35:42,958 --> 00:35:44,000
I don't care.

340
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:47,407
If anything happens to Yo,
I'm going to the police!

341
00:35:48,800 --> 00:35:50,606
Me too.

342
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:55,600
Me too!

343
00:35:55,600 --> 00:35:58,666
I'm just an employee!
You two dragged me into this!

344
00:35:58,666 --> 00:36:00,612
Fine! Go to the police!

345
00:36:00,612 --> 00:36:03,000
Then we can all rot in jail!

346
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,900
Will you two shut up?

347
00:36:05,663 --> 00:36:09,813
Instead of finding a way out,
all you do is panic about jail!

348
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:19,120
Yo!

349
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:29,905
Why are you staring at me like that?

350
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:34,808
Aren't you glad to see me recovered?

351
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:44,918
Or were you hoping I'd stay put
until they found the drugs in my system?

352
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:52,720
I'm just glad you're okay, Yo.

353
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:54,822
I was so worried about you.

354
00:37:07,293 --> 00:37:08,746
She's better already?

355
00:37:08,746 --> 00:37:11,405
She clearly just wanted Nat's attention.

356
00:37:18,886 --> 00:37:20,924
I woke up and no one was there.

357
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:24,217
All I wanted was to come home.

358
00:37:26,480 --> 00:37:28,311
I'm sorry, Yo.

359
00:37:30,240 --> 00:37:34,115
We still have a lot of unfinished business.

360
00:37:42,080 --> 00:37:44,111
Let me pour us a drink.

361
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:11,565
What's gotten into you?

362
00:38:11,565 --> 00:38:14,112
I've never seen you drink.

363
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,720
I just feel like drinking today.

364
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:22,200
You can spike my drink like you did last time.

365
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:24,214
Then we can have some real fun.

366
00:38:30,160 --> 00:38:31,421
How does that sound?

367
00:38:49,640 --> 00:38:51,915
I'll be waiting for you in our room.

368
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,616
Don't keep me waiting.

369
00:39:04,240 --> 00:39:06,811
Your wife isn't up to something, is she?

370
00:39:07,819 --> 00:39:10,907
Yo seems strange to me too. I'll handle her.

371
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:21,413
What should we do, Pam?

372
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:25,240
I don't know.

373
00:39:25,240 --> 00:39:27,614
Let's play along with her for now.

374
00:39:50,520 --> 00:39:52,995
Please forgive me, Yo.

375
00:39:52,995 --> 00:39:55,417
I promise I'll never do this again.

376
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:03,604
You once told me you loved me so much.

377
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:07,213
Then prove it.

378
00:40:07,924 --> 00:40:11,305
Between the two women
who were in on it with you,

379
00:40:12,680 --> 00:40:14,508
one is your mistress,

380
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,404
the other is your servant.

381
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:20,920
Which one will you deal with first?

382
00:40:28,720 --> 00:40:30,617
Can't choose?

383
00:40:32,600 --> 00:40:34,208
Then...

384
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:39,931
I choose you...

385
00:40:39,931 --> 00:40:43,008
my dear husband.

386
00:40:49,160 --> 00:40:50,320
Yo!

387
00:40:56,680 --> 00:40:57,880
Yo!

388
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,200
Yo...

389
00:41:02,240 --> 00:41:03,806
Yo... don't!

390
00:41:13,600 --> 00:41:14,912
Yo...

391
00:41:20,720 --> 00:41:22,610
Keep your voice down.

392
00:41:23,600 --> 00:41:26,205
Or hell might find you.

393
00:41:36,720 --> 00:41:37,880
<i>Help me!</i>

394
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:41,413
<i>- Focus your mind. Think only of Yo.
- Help me!</i>

395
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:43,120
<i>Go back!</i>

396
00:41:43,120 --> 00:41:44,880
<i>Have you never loved me, Master?</i>

397
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:47,480
<i>Kadkao is the only one in my heart.</i>

398
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:49,000
<i>What did Kadkao ever do to you?</i>

399
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:50,760
<i>She's Lert's heart.</i>

400
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,920
<i>No matter the lifetime,
I'll always love this woman.</i>

401
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:54,080
<i>No! No!</i>

402
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,160
<i>I'd rather die!</i>

403
00:41:55,160 --> 00:41:58,315
<i>All you'll get from me is vengeance.</i>

404
00:41:58,893 --> 00:42:00,680
<i>Will you cut it yourself,</i>

405
00:42:00,680 --> 00:42:02,613
<i>or do you want me to do it?</i>
